  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Women Journalists and Human Rights Defenders in Yemen, Iraq, Sudan, West Bank and Gaza Strip</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the project is to bring about an improved situation of W/HRDs working with media to promote womens and girls rights in Iraq, Sudan, Yemen, West Bank and Gaza (impact), the project will work toward creating a more enabling environment in target countries for women journalists, citizen journalists and other W/HRDs to use media for promoting and defending the rights of women and girls (outcome).</narrative>
  </description>
